07", "Tracking Text": "Tracking since 4 Nov 2026 (day 1)"}, {"rule_order": "24", "id": "CON-04", "title": "Detection limits are stable within what was measured", "dimension": "Consistency", "severity": "Major", "status": "For review", "failed": "13", "eligible": "96", "failed_pct": "13.542", "test_outcome": "Caught", "owner_role": "Data Owner (Results)", "why": "A \"below 500\" and a \"below 0.001\" under one name can't share a model column unexplained. Some of this is legitimate, because a strong sample is diluted.", "months_packed": "", "runs_packed": "2026-11-04:R:13", "Selected Rule Id": "VAL-07", "Tracking Text": "Tracking since 4 Nov 2026 (day 1)"}, {"rule_order": "25", "id": "ACC-01", "title": "pH is usually between 4 and 11", "dimension": "Accuracy (plausibility)", "severity": "Minor", "status": "For review", "failed": "27", "eligible": "15894", "failed_pct": "0.17", "test_outcome": "Caught", "owner_role": "Data Owner (Results)", "why": "Possible, but unusual enough for a person to look at.", "months_packed": "2024-12:R:2:658;2025-01:R:1:750;2025-02:R:1:779;2025-03:R:2:724;2025-04:R:1:705;2025-05:R:1:720;2025-06:R:1:632;2025-07:R:3:758;2025-08:P:0:793;2025-09:P:0:722;2025-10:R:1:738;2025-11:R:2:733;2025-12:P:0:695;2026-01:P:0:753;2026-02:P:0:860;2026-03:P:0:791;2026-04:R:4:680;2026-05:P:0:698;2026-06:R:3:525;2026-07:R:2:639;2026-08:R:1:614;2026-09:R:2:547;2026-10:P:0:380", "runs_packed": "2026-11-04:R:27", "Selected Rule Id": "VAL-07", "Tracking Text": "Tracking since 4 Nov 2026 (day 1)"}, {"rule_order": "26", "id": "ACC-02", "title": "Water temperature is between -2 and 40 degrees", "dimension": "Accuracy (plausibility)", "severity": "Minor", "status": "For review", "failed": "4", "eligible": "18034", "failed_pct": "0.022", "test_outcome": "Caught", "owner_role": "Data Owner (Results)", "why": "Above this it is more likely an effluent, a typing slip or the wrong unit than a natural water.", "months_packed": "2024-12:P:0:652;2025-01:P:0:791;2025-02:P:0:857;2025-03:P:0:767;2025-04:R:1:761;2025-05:R:1:888;2025-06:P:0:837;2025-07:P:0:980;2025-08:P:0:990;2025-09:P:0:881;2025-10:P:0:759;2025-11:P:0:760;2025-12:P:0:686;2026-01:P:0:724;2026-02:P:0:853;2026-03:P:0:790;2026-04:P:0:687;2026-05:P:0:795;2026-06:R:2:765;2026-07:P:0:876;2026-08:P:0:826;2026-09:P:0:670;2026-10:P:0:439", "runs_packed": "2026-11-04:R:4", "Selected Rule Id": "VAL-07", "Tracking Text": "Tracking since 4 Nov 2026 (day 1)"}, {"rule_order": "27", "id": "ACC-03", "title": "No result is over 1,000 times the usual level", "dimension": "Accuracy (plausibility)", "severity": "Minor", "status": "For review", "failed": "190", "eligible": "333924", "failed_pct": "0.057", "test_outcome": "Caught", "owner_role": "Data Owner (Results)", "why": "One extreme value can dominate an average. Many will be real, and they are worth checking before they drive a headline.", "months_packed": "2024-12:R:10:12494;2025-01:R:8:15747;2025-02:R:16:16550;2025-03:R:11:13985;2025-04:R:8:14347;2025-05:R:8:14594;2025-06:R:6:13955;2025-07:R:8:17718;2025-08:R:7:17566;2025-09:R:3:15365;2025-10:R:9:14903;2025-11:R:7:13967;2025-12:P:0:14186;2026-01:R:4:15892;2026-02:R:1:17070;2026-03:R:3:15200;2026-04:R:12:13349;2026-05:R:5:14549;2026-06:R:11:13874;2026-07:R:12:16373;2026-08:R:7:15144;2026-09:R:14:11553;2026-10:R:20:5543", "runs_packed": "2026-11-04:R:190", "Selected Rule Id": "VAL-07", "Tracking Text": "Tracking since 4 Nov 2026 (day 1)"}, {"rule_order": "28", "id": "ACC-04", "title": "Above-range results are treated as ceilings", "dimension": "Accuracy", "severity": "Major", "status": "For review", "failed": "483", "eligible": "346832", "failed_pct": "0.139", "test_outcome": "Caught", "owner_role": "Data Owner (Results)", "why": "\">9999999\" means at least that much. Strip the sign and a ceiling becomes a measurement that swamps any average.", "months_packed": "2024-12:R:11:12882;2025-01:R:21:16105;2025-02:R:21:17218;2025-03:R:15:14141;2025-04:R:39:14547;2025-05:R:22:14777;2025-06:R:28:14201;2025-07:R:34:18077;2025-08:R:45:18218;2025-09:R:40:15641;2025-10:R:9:15281;2025-11:R:13:14846;2025-12:R:6:15567;2026-01:R:7:16630;2026-02:R:14:17680;2026-03:R:12:15663;2026-04:R:8:17223;2026-05:R:17:14775;2026-06:R:21:14048;2026-07:R:23:16700;2026-08:R:40:15374;2026-09:R:21:11660;2026-10:R:16:5578", "runs_packed": "2026-11-04:R:483", "Selected Rule Id": "VAL-07", "Tracking Text": "Tracking since 4 Nov 2026 (day 1)"}, {"rule_order": "29", "id": "REC-01", "title": "Bathing E. coli matches between the two services", "dimension": "Reconciliation", "severity": "Major", "status": "Pass", "failed": "1", "eligible": "604", "failed_pct": "0.166", "test_outcome": "Caught", "owner_role": "Data Owner (Bathing Waters)", "why": "Two independent public services agreeing is strong evidence that the data is sound.", "months_packed": "2026-05:P:0:70;2026-06:P:0:143;2026-07:P:0:146;2026-08:P:0:137;2026-09:P:1:108", "runs_packed": "2026-11-04:P:1", "Selected Rule Id": "VAL-07", "Tracking Text": "Tracking since 4 Nov 2026 (day 1)"}, {"rule_order": "30", "id": "REC-02", "title": "Every bathing point can be linked between services", "dimension": "Reconciliation", "severity": "Minor", "status": "Fail", "failed": "6", "eligible": "35", "failed_pct": "17.143", "test_outcome": "Caught", "owner_role": "Data Owner (Bathing Waters)", "why": "The only link is a five-digit code inside a free-text label. The data agrees, but the key that joins it isn't governed.", "months_packed": "", "runs_packed": "2026-11-04:F:6", "Selected Rule Id": "VAL-07", "Tracking Text": "Tracking since 4 Nov 2026 (day 1)"}, {"rule_order": "31", "id": "PRV-01", "title": "Labels hold no apparent personal data", "dimension": "Privacy", "severity": "Major", "status": "For review", "failed": "774", "eligible": "8200", "failed_pct": "9.439", "test_outcome": "Caught", "owner_role": "Data Owner (Sampling Points)", "why": "Labels run several fields together, including addresses. The source is public, but republishing a home address has to be a deliberate decision.", "months_packed": "", "runs_packed": "2026-11-04:R:774", "Selected Rule Id": "VAL-07", "Tracking Text": "Tracking since 4 Nov 2026 (day 1)"}, {"rule_order": "32", "id": "PRV-02", "title": "Nothing about to be published holds personal data", "dimension": "Privacy", "severity": "Critical", "status": "Pass", "failed": "0", "eligible": "3989", "failed_pct": "0.0", "test_outcome": "Caught", "owner_role": "Data Owner (Sampling Points)", "why": "The last check before anything leaves the building. If this fails, the affected field isn't published.", "months_packed": "", "runs_packed": "2026-11-04:P:0", "Selected Rule Id": "VAL-07", "Tracking Text": "Tracking since 4 Nov 2026 (day 1)"}, {"rule_order": "33", "id": "AI-01", "title": "Below-limit share is within what a model can handle", "dimension": "AI readiness", "severity": "Major", "status": "Fail", "failed": "5", "eligible": "7", "failed_pct": "71.429", "test_outcome": "Caught", "owner_role": "Analytics Lead", "why": "When much of a target is only known to be \"below something\", a model needs special handling, or it learns the limit and not the water.", "months_packed": "", "runs_packed": "2026-11-04:F:5", "Selected Rule Id": "VAL-07", "Tracking Text": "Tracking since 4 Nov 2026 (day 1)"}, {"rule_order": "34", "id": "AI-02", "title": "Samples cover the whole week", "dimension": "AI readiness", "severity": "Major", "status": "Fail", "failed": "118", "eligible": "168", "failed_pct": "70.238", "test_outcome": "Caught", "owner_role": "Analytics Lead", "why": "A model can't learn about hours it has never seen. Sampling happens in working hours, so nights and weekends are almost absent.", "months_packed": "", "runs_packed": "2026-11-04:F:118", "Selected Rule Id": "VAL-07", "Tracking Text": "Tracking since 4 Nov 2026 (day 1)"}, {"rule_order": "35", "id": "AI-03", "title": "Enough repeat samples per point", "dimension": "AI readiness", "severity": "Major", "status": "Fail", "failed": "717", "eligible": "784", "failed_pct": "91.454", "test_outcome": "Caught", "owner_role": "Analytics Lead", "why": "Under one sample a month, a model can't separate a place's pattern from noise.", "months_packed": "", "runs_packed": "2026-11-04:F:717", "Selected Rule Id": "VAL-07", "Tracking Text": "Tracking since 4 Nov 2026 (day 1)"}, {"rule_order": "36", "id": "AI-04", "title": "Clock times are real times, not defaults", "dimension": "AI readiness", "severity": "Major", "status": "Fail", "failed": "5526", "eligible": "39943", "failed_pct": "13.835", "test_outcome": "Caught", "owner_role": "Analytics Lead", "why": "When one minute takes a large share of a stream's samples, it looks like a convention and not a time. Time-of-day can't then be used as an input. Why this happens is unconfirmed.", "months_packed": "2024-12:F:305:1761;2025-01:F:369:1900;2025-02:F:202:1693;2025-03:F:230:1614;2025-04:F:209:1659;2025-05:F:198:1854;2025-06:F:203:1842;2025-07:F:237:2084;2025-08:F:208:1956;2025-09:F:213:1857;2025-10:F:306:1867;2025-11:F:345:1884;2025-12:F:425:1878;2026-01:F:385:1790;2026-02:F:238:1644;2026-03:F:233:1685;2026-04:F:201:1525;2026-05:F:194:1756;2026-06:F:214:1850;2026-07:F:207:1972;2026-08:F:234:1793;2026-09:F:170:1484;2026-10:P:0:595", "runs_packed": "2026-11-04:F:5526", "Selected Rule Id": "VAL-07", "Tracking Text": "Tracking since 4 Nov 2026 (day 1)"}, {"rule_order": "37", "id": "AUD-01", "title": "The change ledger has run long enough to trust", "dimension": "Audit trail", "severity": "Major", "status": "Fail", "failed": "34", "eligible": "35", "failed_pct": "97.143", "test_outcome": "Caught", "owner_role": "Data Owner (Results)", "why": "The publisher says records may change as quality assurance continues, and refreshes monthly. Until the ledger has covered a full cycle, nobody can say how often published figures move.", "months_packed": "", "runs_packed": "2026-11-04:F:34", "Selected Rule Id": "VAL-07", "Tracking Text": "Tracking since 4 Nov 2026 (day 1)"}, {"rule_order": "38", "id": "AUD-02", "title": "Licence statements agree", "dimension": "Audit trail", "severity": "Minor", "status": "For review", "failed": "1", "eligible": "3", "failed_pct": "33.333", "test_outcome": "Caught", "owner_role": "Data Owner (Results)", "why": "The service, its catalogue record and its sister service should give the same licence. A figure can't be signed off on an unclear right to reuse it.", "months_packed": "", "runs_packed": "2026-11-04:R:1", "Selected Rule Id": "VAL-07", "Tracking Text": "Tracking since 4 Nov 2026 (day 1)"}, {"rule_order": "39", "id": "AUD-03", "title": "There are no gaps in the run history", "dimension": "Audit trail", "severity": "Minor", "status": "Pass", "failed": "0", "eligible": "1", "failed_pct": "0.0", "test_outcome": "Caught", "owner_role": "Data Owner (Results)", "why": "A control that didn't run looks exactly like a control that found nothing, unless the gaps are counted.", "months_packed": "2026-11:P:0:1", "runs_packed": "2026-11-04:P:0", "Selected Rule Id": "VAL-07", "Tracking Text": "Tracking since 4 Nov 2026 (day 1)"}, {"rule_order": "40", "id": "CHK-01", "title": "Every rule caught its planted defect last night", "dimension": "Checking the checker", "severity": "Critical", "status": "Pass", "failed": "0", "eligible": "39", "failed_pct": "0.0", "test_outcome": "Proved by its own test", "owner_role": "Data Owner (Results)", "why": "A check that can't fail proves nothing. Each night a defect is planted in a private copy to prove each rule still fires.", "months_packed": "", "runs_packed": "2026-11-04:P:0", "Selected Rule Id": "VAL-07", "Tracking Text": "Tracking since 4 Nov 2026 (day 1)"}]